                "On the TL-HIL bench at Tantalate-Lode the seed puck on RT-2 is already clicking 48 pps "
                "over a 12 pps quiet-band, while the coil CT still shows 38 kA under 52. Parking the "
                "12 MW tap is the legal gate; riding the current would have energized a noisy electrode. "
                "Production-pit amps are not the authority here.",